# 4. SQLite Database Files
# NOTE: The uncompressed SQLite database is ~126MB, which exceeds GitHub's 100MB limit.
# The repository tracks the compressed archive `data/swasthya_grid.db.zip` (22MB).
# `backend/database.py` automatically extracts it upon first launch.
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite3
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# Keep the compressed archive
!data/swasthya_grid.db.zip

# 5. IDE & Editor Artifacts
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.project
.pydevproject
.settings/

